              <p style="margin: 2px 0; font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.2;">BDO-2560103733; BPI-0279101938</p>
              <p style="margin: 2px 0; font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.2;">Channel International Enterprises/William P. Abugan</p>
              <p style="margin: 2px 0; font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.2;">Metrobank 4813481138419, Land Bank 0231 1915 85</p>
            </div>

